281: ## Call stacks
282: 
283: ### Discovery and registration
284: 
285: ```text
286: client -> unauthenticated MCP -> 401 challenge -> protected-resource metadata
287:        -> authorization metadata -> dynamic registration
288:        -> rate/size boundary -> DCR policy -> provider -> PostgreSQL adapter
289:        -> strict registration response
290: ```
291: 
292: ### Login, consent, and code
293: 
294: ```text
295: authorization(resource + S256 + state)
296:   -> provider validates client/redirect/resource/PKCE
297:   -> auth-host bootstrap reads provider cookie/state
298:   -> create hashed handoff -> redirect to CommonCal login
299:   -> existing session OR password/magic-link login with stored continuation
300:   -> private lookup -> login decision -> browser returns to auth-host resume
301:   -> consume handoff -> provider completes login
302:   -> new bootstrap/handoff -> CommonCal consent
303:   -> reload interaction + calendars + scope catalog -> CSRF decision
304:   -> SQLite validate + replace/upsert grant + audit
305:   -> private consent/denial decision -> browser returns to auth-host resume
306:   -> consume handoff -> provider completes consent -> one-time code
307: ```
308: 
309: ### Token and MCP call
310: 
311: ```text
312: token(code + verifier + same resource)
313:   -> provider verifies code/S256/resource/client -> consume code
314:   -> JWT access token + rotated refresh state
315: MCP initialize/tools/list/tools/call
316:   -> Bearer/Origin -> metadata/JWKS -> signature/exact claims
317:   -> active grant(user, client) -> SDK dispatch
318:   -> scope AND capability/calendar checks -> internal API -> result + audit
319: ```
320: 
321: ### Immediate revocation
322: 
323: ```text
324: authenticated user -> revoke(grant_id AND user_id)
325: next MCP request -> JWT valid -> active grant absent -> 403
326: ```
